# The entry points of the estimator World (ardupilot/translate_estimation.sh, --use @estimation.use; README.md "Phase 3:
# the estimator World and the EKF3 replay"): the sensor front ends' (ardupilot/Sensors.use) and NavEKF3's
# (ardupilot/ekf3.use), plus what the replay calls and reads besides: AP_AHRS's set_terrain_hgt_stable forwards to
# NavEKF3::setTerrainHgtStable, the scheduler stand-in's harness entries, and the per-core getters the reference's probe
# reads (reference/hal/est_probe.cpp: c<k>.fs, c<k>.var, c<k>.gsf).
